<subpara id="X39400000QY01GC_12" type-id="51" category="05" proc-id="RM0550J___00002T800000">
<name>Inspection Procedure</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<atten4>
<ptxt>Read the freeze frame data using SST (TaSCAN). The freeze frame data records part of the engine operating condition when the malfunction occurred, and this information is useful when troubleshooting.</ptxt>
</atten4>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="X39400000QY01GC_13" type-id="01" category="01">
<name>Procedure</name>
<testgrp id="X39400000QY01GC_13_0018" proc-id="RM0550J___00002TH00000">
<scantool type="2"/>
<testtitle>Clear DTC</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09991-70200</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Connect SST (TaSCAN) to DLC3.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Turn the IG ON and clear the DTCs following the SST (TaSCAN) screen display. (see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM000000CCX015X"/>)</ptxt>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="X39400000QY01GC_13_0001" fin="false">NEXT</down>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="X39400000QY01GC_13_0001" proc-id="RM0550J___00002T900000">
<scantool type="1"/>
<testtitle>Read DTC</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09991-70200</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Perform a road test.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Check the DTCs by following the SST (TaSCAN) screen display. (see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM000000CCX015X"/>)</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Specified Condition</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="2" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="3.33in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="0.80in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Result</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Either P0011 or P0012 is output</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>A</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Codes other than P0011 and P0012 are also output</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>B</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="X39400000QY01GC_13_0002" fin="false">A</down>
<right ref="X39400000QY01GC_13_0011" fin="true">B</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="X39400000QY01GC_13_0002" proc-id="RM0550J___00002TA00000">
<testtitle>Check for Rough Idle or Engine Stall</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<test1>
<ptxt>Check the engine idle condition.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Result</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="2">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="3.31in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="0.82in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Vehicle Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Engine stalls or idles roughly</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>A</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Normal idle speed</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>B</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="X39400000QY01GC_13_0003" fin="false">A</down>
<right ref="X39400000QY01GC_13_0004" fin="false">B</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="X39400000QY01GC_13_0003" proc-id="RM0550J___00002TB00000">
<testtitle>Inspect Valve Timing</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<test1>
<ptxt>Timing Inspection</ptxt>
<test2>
<ptxt>Remove the cylinder head cover.</ptxt>
</test2>
<test2>
<ptxt>Turn the crankshaft clockwise and align the notch of the crankshaft pulley with the 0° position.</ptxt>
</test2>
<test2>
<ptxt>As shown in the illustration, check that the timing marks of the camshaft timing gears are aligned. If the marks are not aligned, turn the crankshaft clockwise 1 more revolution.</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="A160964J01" width="2.775699831in" height="3.779676365in"/>
</figure>
<spec>
<title>Specified Condition</title>
<specitem>
<ptxt>Timing marks are aligned</ptxt>
</specitem>
</spec>
<spec>
<title>Result</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="2" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="2.07in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="2.06in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Result</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Timing marks are not aligned</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>A</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Timing marks are aligned</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>B</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</test2>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="X39400000QY01GC_13_0012" fin="true">A</down>
<right ref="X39400000QY01GC_13_0005" fin="false">B</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="X39400000QY01GC_13_0004" proc-id="RM0550J___00002TC00000">
<scantool type="8"/>
<testtitle>Perform TaSCAN Active Test (VVT Control)</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09991-70200</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Connect SST (TaSCAN) to DLC3.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>With the engine stopped, turn the IG ON.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Following the SST (TaSCAN) screen display, select [Active Test] - [VVT Control].</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>With the engine idling, perform [OFF/ON].</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Specified Condition</title>
<table frame="all" colsep="1" rowsep="1">
<tgroup cols="2" colsep="1" rowsep="1">
<colspec colnum="01" colname="C01" colwidth="2.07in"/>
<colspec colnum="02" colname="C02" colwidth="2.06in"/>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry colname="C01" valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Performed (OCV operates)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname="C02" valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Engine stalls or idles roughly</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry colname="C01" valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Not performed (OCV does not operate)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname="C02" valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Normal idle speed</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="X39400000QY01GC_13_0010" fin="true">OK</down>
<right ref="X39400000QY01GC_13_0005" fin="false">NG</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="X39400000QY01GC_13_0005" proc-id="RM0550J___00002TD00000">
<testtitle>Inspect Camshaft Timing Oil Control Valve Assembly</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09082-00030</s-number>
</sstitem>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09083-00170</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Resistance Inspection</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="A166780J01" width="2.775699831in" height="1.771723296in"/>
</figure>
<test2>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), measure the resistance between the terminals.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Resistance</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="3" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.38in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.38in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="1.37in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Tester Connection</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Standard</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>1 - 2</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Approx. 20°C</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>6.9 to 7.9Ω</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</test2>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Operation Check</ptxt>
<test2>
<ptxt>Apply battery voltage between the terminals and inspect the spool valve condition.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Specified Condition</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="3" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.38in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.38in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="1.37in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Tester Connection</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Specified Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>1 - 2</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Battery voltage</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Valve operates</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
<atten3>
<ptxt>Check that the spool valve is not stuck.</ptxt>
</atten3>
<atten4>
<ptxt>A spool valve that does not return properly due to foreign matter such as sludge being caught may cause a slight pressure leak to the advance side, which may cause a DTC to be detected.</ptxt>
</atten4>
</test2>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="X39400000QY01GC_13_0006" fin="false">OK</down>
<right ref="X39400000QY01GC_13_0013" fin="true">NG</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="X39400000QY01GC_13_0006" proc-id="RM0550J___00002TE00000">
<testtitle>Inspect Valve Timing</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<atten4>
<ptxt>If the valve timing inspection has already been performed, go to the next step</ptxt>
</atten4>
<test1>
<ptxt>Timing Inspection</ptxt>
<test2>
<ptxt>Remove the cylinder head cover.</ptxt>
</test2>
<test2>
<ptxt>Turn the crankshaft clockwise and align the notch of the crankshaft pulley with the 0° position.</ptxt>
</test2>
<test2>
<ptxt>As shown in the illustration, check that the timing marks of the camshaft timing gears are aligned. If the marks are not aligned, turn the crankshaft clockwise 1 more revolution.</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="A160964J01" width="2.775699831in" height="3.779676365in"/>
</figure>
<spec>
<title>Specified Condition</title>
<specitem>
<ptxt>Timing marks are aligned</ptxt>
</specitem>
</spec>
</test2>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="X39400000QY01GC_13_0008" fin="false">OK</down>
<right ref="X39400000QY01GC_13_0012" fin="true">NG</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="X39400000QY01GC_13_0008" proc-id="RM0550J___00002TF00000">
<testtitle>Inspect Oil Control Valve Filter</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<test1>
<ptxt>Using a socket hexagon wrench, remove the plug at the position shown in the illustration, and remove the oil control valve filter.</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="A128210J07" width="2.775699831in" height="1.771723296in"/>
</figure>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Check the oil control valve filter for clogging.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Specified Condition</title>
<specitem>
<ptxt>There is no clogging or adhering foreign matter</ptxt>
</specitem>
</spec>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="X39400000QY01GC_13_0019" fin="false">OK</down>
<right ref="X39400000QY01GC_13_0015" fin="true">NG</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="X39400000QY01GC_13_0019" proc-id="RM0550J___00002TI00000">
<scantool type="2"/>
<testtitle>Clear DTC</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09991-70200</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Connect SST (TaSCAN) to DLC3.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Turn the IG ON and clear the DTCs following the SST (TaSCAN) screen display. (see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM000000CCX015X"/>)</ptxt>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="X39400000QY01GC_13_0009" fin="false">NEXT</down>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="X39400000QY01GC_13_0009" proc-id="RM0550J___00002TG00000">
<scantool type="1"/>
<testtitle>Read DTC</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09991-70200</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Perform a road test.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Check the DTCs by following the SST (TaSCAN) screen display. (see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM000000CCX015X"/>)</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Specified Condition</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="2" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="3.33in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="0.80in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Result</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Either P0011 or P0012 is output</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>A</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>No output</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>B</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
<atten4>
<ptxt>The DTC judgment can be confirmed using the [Diagnosis Judgment Result Check] function of SST (TaSCAN). (see <xref label="Seep02" href="RM000000CCX015X"/>)</ptxt>
</atten4>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="X39400000QY01GC_13_0010" fin="true">A</down>
<right ref="X39400000QY01GC_13_0020" fin="true">B</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="X39400000QY01GC_13_0010">
<testtitle>Replace Engine Control Computer<xref label="Seep01" href="RM0000020V0005X"/>
</testtitle>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="X39400000QY01GC_13_0011">
<testtitle>Go to Related DTC Chart<xref label="Seep01" href="X39400000QT013D"/>
</testtitle>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="X39400000QY01GC_13_0012">
<testtitle>Valve Timing Adjustment</testtitle>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="X39400000QY01GC_13_0013">
<testtitle>Replace Camshaft Timing Oil Control Valve Assembly<xref label="Seep01" href="RM0000020UX009X"/>
</testtitle>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="X39400000QY01GC_13_0015">
<testtitle>Replace Oil Control Valve Filter</testtitle>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="X39400000QY01GC_13_0020">
<testtitle>END</testtitle>
</testgrp>
</subpara>
</para>
</ttl>
